<title>INDIA: India Sundram 96/97 6-mth net up 28 pct.</title>
<headline>India Sundram 96/97 6-mth net up 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	 193.0   vs     150.4</p>
<p>    Net sales	1,878.3   vs   1,445.8</p>
<p>    Shr (in rupees)*  37.79  vs	58.88</p>
<p>    Other income	 3.7   vs	 5.8</p>
<p>    Expenditure    1,519.3   vs   1,167.1</p>
<p>    Interest costs   103.3   vs	64.5</p>
<p>    Depreciation	34.9   vs	27.1</p>
<p>    Tax		   31.5   vs	42.5</p>
<p>* Note: Sundram Fasteners Ltd said in a statement the earnings per share (annualised) for the current year was calculated on an enhanced capital after a 1:1 bonus share issue.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
